ai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KingAlejandro/MotionCorr-standalone/issues/comments/6249609729","html_url":"https://github.com/KingAlejandro/MotionCorr-standalone/pull/46#issuecomment-6249609729","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KingAlejandro/MotionCorr-standalone/issues/46","id":6249609729,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUnH-pc8AAAABdIF6AQ","user":{"login":"KingAlejandro","id":72450765,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNDUwNzY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72450765?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingAlejandro","html_url":"https://github.com/KingAlejandro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingAlejandro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingAlejandro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingAlejandro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingAlejandro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingAlejandro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingAlejandro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingAlejandro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingAlejandro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingAlejandro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-18T11:55:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T11:55:07Z","body":"Recommendation: do not merge this historical stack as-is. Reviewed 2ef82b02, the feasibility ADR, subsequent #52 evidence and the current-main comparison. The ADR still says Completed / Ready for Implementation and projects roughly 10–14x end-to-end speedup, but the later retained real-movie measurement is only an exploratory 1.04x two-run ratio with relaxed Gate 2 failure. The projected <45 ms patch and 15–25 ms resampling numbers should remain clearly identified as assumptions, not measured acceptance.\n\nThis is also broader than an ADR: the cb3699ac comparison contains Metal runtime/build changes and presentation assets, and the branch is 595 commits behind. Preserve historical design/evidence separately from any renewed implementation. The Closes #35 implication is unsupported by #52's stated remaining acceptance and #119's later absolute-RMSE failures. No new run or exhaustive kernel/presentation audit was performed; this is scope/evidence triage.","author_association":"OWNER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KingAlejandro/MotionCorr-standalone/issues/comments/6249609729/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/foll